{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"748242aec6537c8acd76171ea018edaef1f57255c650488a19aa41caf4d2dd84","ja":"新年の劇場","zh":"新年的剧场","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"c99f053285d4d95bcb5e03ca081344da4531e4c776fa770faf02f4550306cdfb","ja":"おや？　新年で劇場にはあまり人がいないかと\n思っていたのですが……。","zh":"哎呀？我还以为因为是新年，\n剧场里应该没什么人呢……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e3d4669756b17343fcf02a9c5973cda5c784ec9ea1dd4ffc3da85069767e53a9","ja":"茜、可奈、あけましておめでとうございます。","zh":"茜、可奈，新年快乐。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"97bfac2891de7dfc3951838a9cb3c82246fbe5251830a6a081c4fd37d7b33aa6","ja":"あっ、貴音さん。\nあけましておめでとうございま～す！","zh":"啊，贵音小姐。\n新年快乐～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"1a675bf54f1233533879f72676d89d8b7f58c4810efaee34586b2137993d835a","ja":"あけおめ～……って、\nもしかして貴音ちゃんも、お年玉を貰いに来たの？","zh":"新年快乐～……等等，\n难道小贵音也是来要压岁钱的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"bfe9b42f1e00f5560c32f1f31d1f7bfa83ffa6ee213add680c5b948e05735828","ja":"いえ、私は劇場に新年の挨拶をと。\n可奈と茜は一緒に来たのですか？","zh":"不，我是来剧场拜年的。\n可奈和茜是一起来的吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2d16ef156df9d38adec025887f00e55b731f35c630fb5e43c7b028446d8bb9e7","ja":"私も劇場に挨拶しようと思って来たんです。\nそしたら、茜さんとばったり会って……。","zh":"我也是想来剧场打个招呼才过来的。\n结果正好碰到了茜小姐……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"14a9d32f34fab08e64455cbcab32d7d774bd76ba6ce81b738cf0b2d2ad445f00","ja":"いやいや～、ここでお年玉を貰いに行く茜ちゃんに\n出会えるなんて、まさしく運命だよね！","zh":"哎呀呀～，居然能在这里碰上去拿压岁钱的小茜，\n这绝对就是命中注定吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"c6840b31c681e7b64df0ba0eee0c0ee5869af551081e02d6bcd239b9d41b5eb1","ja":"きっと、「茜ちゃんと一緒にお年玉を貰いに行くことが\n吉」っていう、神様のお導きだよ！","zh":"这一定是神明的指引，在告诉我们\n“和小茜一起去拿压岁钱才是上上签”！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e82305a5d86794087a89daff0ce39af7587690956d42c566ce967d068313f2f8","ja":"だから、ふたりとも茜ちゃんと一緒に\nお年玉を貰いに行くべきなんだよっ。ねっ、お願い！","zh":"所以，你们两个都应该和小茜一起\n去要压岁钱才对嘛。好不好，求求你们啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"f68ecbbd0657e3a913ba199cacafbcd6dc85ecd91a1dcf043862e4643e2dad92","ja":"ふふっ。茜がそこまで言うのなら、仕方ありませんね。\n可奈はどうしますか？","zh":"呵呵。既然茜都说到这个份上了，那也没办法呢。\n可奈要怎么做？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"bfaa4a8ab27ccfd810916bf5724727a5189cc480266f20b671026c6884e4ac47","ja":"それなら、私も一緒に行きます！\nでも、劇場に挨拶はしておきたいな～。","zh":"那样的话，我也一起去！\n不过，还是想先跟剧场打个招呼呢～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"3257022b8481276f584c14f0882847a0f442bf0391c9707c73f9a468f2fb52ba","ja":"では、皆で劇場に新年の挨拶をしてから、\n●●●●プロデューサーの元へ参るとしましょう。","zh":"那么，大家先去剧场拜个年后，\n就去●●●●制作人那里吧。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"4393efb1ced16d238d8d08caa85c6488a5ed42e04e872f5594d092656221f7c2","ja":"やった～！　人数が多い方が、\n●●●●プロデューサーちゃんが断りづらい……。","zh":"太好了～！　人越多的话，\n制作人小哥就越难拒绝……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1347.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"be7e6130d4a22bf03ee341645907df65dac79c54785f16c2d5b87bdf120317e0","ja":"じゃなくて、一緒に行ってくれると心強いよ。\n可奈ちゃん、貴音ちゃん、ありがとう！","zh":"不是啦，你们能陪我一起去，我就放心多了。\n可奈、贵音，谢谢你们！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
